### Variables (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP)
@base = http://localhost:3001
@token = PASTE_JWT_HERE

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Registro (empresa + usuario; opcional company_phone / company_email)
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mi Empresa SRL",
  "rnc": "131123456",
  "address": "Av. Winston Churchill, Santo Domingo",
  "email": "admin@miempresa.com",
  "password": "secreta123",
  "company_phone": "809-555-0100",
  "company_email": "facturacion@miempresa.com"
}

### Login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@miempresa.com",
  "password": "secreta123"
}

### Sesión actual (requiere Bearer)
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear solo cliente (sin cotización)
POST {{base}}/clients
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Cliente de prueba",
  "rnc_cedula": "00123456789",
  "phone": "809-555-0100",
  "email": "cliente@example.com"
}

### Cliente + cotización + ítems (transacción; totales ITBIS 18% en servidor)
POST {{base}}/clients-with-cotizacion
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "client": {
    "name": "Comercial XYZ",
    "rnc_cedula": "40216956781",
    "phone": "829-555-0200",
    "email": "compras@xyz.com"
  },
  "cotizacion": {
    "payment_terms": "50% avance, 50% contra entrega",
    "account_manager": "María Pérez"
  },
  "items": [
    {
      "quantity": 2,
      "unit": "Servicio",
      "description": "Consultoría fiscal mensual",
      "unit_price": 15000
    },
    {
      "quantity": 1,
      "unit": "Unidad",
      "description": "Software licencia anual",
      "unit_price": 45000
    }
  ]
}

### Listar clientes del tenant
GET {{base}}/clients
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar cotizaciones del tenant
GET {{base}}/cotizaciones
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detalle cotización + vista previa DGII (sin API real aún)
GET {{base}}/cotizaciones/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
